name: intake brief co-creation dashboard and tool\
\
Description: I want to create a web app dashboard with a workflow and tool that would guide users through a structured workflow for co-authoring a work intake for creative work within a marketing department. I want this to be a an ai assisted conversational context gathering between the user and the llm. The information will be gathered and collected in a review ui dashboard what will eventually be connected via API other workfront.\
\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 This workflow helps users efficiently organize and create and transfer context through a sequence of context gathering questions. The collection of information will then be used to create an intake queue, that will be submitted to an Adobe Workfront job intake queue for prioritization and execution.\
\
I would like to run human in loop exit conditions where necessary for user input. The intake form should be conversational based on relevant questions that relate gathering context needed to create a creative brief for a marketing team. \
\
Allow the user to validate with fresh perspective.\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
I want to provide screenshots and other documents in my folder to help visualize this.\
\
I will need help defining and creating a reusable workflow with human in the loop checkpoints.\
\
Use when user wants to create a creative brief, strategy brief, proposal, technical specs, decision docs, or similar structured content.\
\
I would like the user to check the folder structure to get more information if needed.\
\
The dashboard would have an easy to use requestor flow, and a reviewer mode, to approve, reject, or send to workfront queue.\
\
\
